{
    "id": "5jwoj.berich.loon",
    "name": "BeRich Loon 合集",
    "description": "Loon 专用订阅合集，包含京东Cookie同步、京豆资产查询、JD账号过期检测、巴士论坛签到、V2EX每日签到等插件的配置管理",
    "author": "@5jwoj",
    "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/loon.png",
    "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich",
    "apps": [
        {
            "id": "jd.cookie.sync.loon",
            "name": "京东Cookie同步 (Loon)",
            "keys": [
                "jd_ql_url",
                "jd_ql_client_id",
                "jd_ql_client_secret"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/JDCK",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">Loon 版 · 自动捕获京东 Cookie 并同步到青龙面板</h4>",
                "<p>每次打开京东 APP，Loon 自动拦截请求并提取 <code>pt_key / pt_pin</code>，直接同步至青龙面板的 <code>JD_COOKIE</code> 环境变量（遵循 QuanX 静默同步与变动通知规则）。</p>",
                "<hr>",
                "<p><b>使用步骤：</b></p>",
                "<ol><li>在 Loon 中安装插件：<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Cookie_Sync_Loon.plugin\">JD_Cookie_Sync_Loon.plugin</a></li><li>在下方填写青龙面板信息并保存</li><li>确保 Loon 开启 MitM 并已信任证书</li><li>打开京东 APP 浏览任意页面即可自动触发同步</li></ol>",
                "<p align=\"center\">使用说明请查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/blob/main/JDCK/README_Loon.md\">README_Loon.md</a></p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_url",
                    "name": "青龙面板地址",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.1:5700",
                    "desc": "青龙面板的完整地址，包括端口号（例如 http://192.168.1.1:5700）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_id",
                    "name": "Client ID",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client ID",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 → 系统设置 → 应用设置中创建应用获取"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_secret",
                    "name": "Client Secret",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client Secret",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 → 系统设置 → 应用设置中创建应用获取（权限需勾选环境变量）"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Cookie_Sync_Loon.js"
        },
        {
            "id": "jd.bean.query.loon",
            "name": "京豆资产查询 (Loon)",
            "keys": [
                "jd_ql_url",
                "jd_ql_client_id",
                "jd_ql_client_secret",
                "jd_asset_script_name",
                "jd_local_pin"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/JDCK",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">Loon 版 · 定时读取青龙面板资产日志，推送京豆汇总通知</h4>",
                "<p>通过青龙面板 Open API 读取资产脚本的最新运行日志，精准过滤指定账号的京豆数据并发送通知。</p>",
                "<hr>",
                "<p><b>使用步骤：</b></p>",
                "<ol><li>在 Loon 中安装插件：<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Bean_Query_Loon.plugin\">JD_Bean_Query_Loon.plugin</a></li><li>在下方填写配置信息并保存</li><li>插件默认每天 23:35 自动执行，也可在 Loon 脚本列表中手动触发</li></ol>",
                "<p><b>注意：</b>青龙面板配置（地址/Client ID/Secret）与 Cookie 同步插件共享，已填写可跳过。</p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_url",
                    "name": "青龙面板地址",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.1:5700",
                    "desc": "青龙面板的完整地址，包括端口号（与其他插件共享，已填写可跳过）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_id",
                    "name": "Client ID",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client ID",
                    "desc": "青龙 Open API Client ID（与其他插件共享）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_secret",
                    "name": "Client Secret",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client Secret",
                    "desc": "青龙 Open API Client Secret（与其他插件共享）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_asset_script_name",
                    "name": "资产脚本名称",
                    "val": "jd_task_assets",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "jd_task_assets",
                    "desc": "青龙中运行资产查询的脚本文件名，默认 jd_task_assets"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_local_pin",
                    "name": "指定京东账号 Pin",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "例如: jd_123456 (多个用逗号分隔)",
                    "desc": "填写需要查询的京东 Pin（支持多个逗号分隔），留空则推送日志中全部账号"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Bean_Query_Loon.js"
        },
        {
            "id": "jd.cookie.check.loon",
            "name": "JD账号过期检测 (Loon)",
            "keys": [
                "jd_ql_url",
                "jd_ql_client_id",
                "jd_ql_client_secret",
                "jd_cookie_check_script",
                "jd_check_pin"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/JDCK",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">Loon 版 · 定时检测京东账号 Cookie 是否过期并推送预警</h4>",
                "<p>自动读取青龙面板中指定脚本的最新日志，扫描 <code>Cookie失效</code>、<code>账号过期</code>、<code>未登录</code> 等关键词，第一时间推送通知。</p>",
                "<hr>",
                "<p><b>使用步骤：</b></p>",
                "<ol><li>在 Loon 中安装插件：<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Cookie_Check_Loon.plugin\">JD_Cookie_Check_Loon.plugin</a></li><li>在下方填写配置信息并保存</li><li>插件默认每天 6:35 ~ 23:35 每小时检测一次，可在 Loon 中修改定时</li></ol>",
                "<p><b>注意：</b>青龙面板配置（地址/Client ID/Secret）与其他插件共享，已填写可跳过。</p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_url",
                    "name": "青龙面板地址",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.1:5700",
                    "desc": "青龙面板的完整地址，包括端口号（与其他插件共享，已填写可跳过）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_id",
                    "name": "Client ID",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client ID",
                    "desc": "青龙 Open API Client ID（与其他插件共享）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_secret",
                    "name": "Client Secret",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client Secret",
                    "desc": "青龙 Open API Client Secret（与其他插件共享）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_cookie_check_script",
                    "name": "检测目标脚本名称",
                    "val": "jd_task_assets",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "jd_task_assets",
                    "desc": "在青龙日志中检测的目标脚本名，默认 jd_task_assets"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_check_pin",
                    "name": "指定检测的 Pin",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "例如: jd_123456 (多个用逗号分隔)",
                    "desc": "指定检测的京东账号 Pin，多个用逗号分隔。留空则检测日志内全部账号"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Cookie_Check_Loon.js"
        },
        {
            "id": "aliyun.cookie.sync.loon",
            "name": "阿里云社区任务 (Loon)",
            "keys": [
                "ql_url",
                "ql_client_id",
                "ql_client_secret",
                "ql_data_name"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/aliyun",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/Aliyun.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/Aliyun.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">Loon 版 · 阿里云社区每日任务自动化</h4>",
                "<p>自动完成阿里云社区签到、点赞、分享、评论、收藏、场景体验、视频观看等每日任务并领取积分。Cookie 同步至青龙面板。</p>",
                "<hr>",
                "<p><b>使用步骤：</b></p>",
                "<ol><li>在 Loon 中安装插件：<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/refs/heads/main/aliyun/aliyun.plugin\">aliyun.plugin</a></li><li>在下方填写青龙面板信息并保存</li><li>确保 Loon 开启 MitM 并已信任证书</li><li>打开阿里云 APP → 首页 → 积分商城，触发抓包自动获取 Cookie 并同步至青龙</li></ol>",
                "<p><b>执行时间：</b>每天 07:00 执行签到与任务，13:00 执行积分领取与操作恢复。</p>",
                "<p align=\"center\">使用说明请查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/aliyun\">aliyun README</a></p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "ql_url",
                    "name": "青龙面板地址",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.1:5700",
                    "desc": "青龙面板的完整地址，包括端口号"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ql_client_id",
                    "name": "Client ID",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client ID",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 → 系统设置 → 应用设置中创建应用获取"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ql_client_secret",
                    "name": "Client Secret",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client Secret",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 → 系统设置 → 应用设置中创建应用获取（权限需勾选环境变量）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ql_data_name",
                    "name": "青龙变量名",
                    "val": "aliyunWeb_data",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "aliyunWeb_data",
                    "desc": "存储到青龙面板的变量名，留空则使用默认值 aliyunWeb_data"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/refs/heads/main/aliyun/aliyun_web_wrapper.js"
        },
        {
